  _subtitle: Crushed by a falling house
  _description: Held the Munchkins in bondage until [[bff2dcff-df4c-46a2-a793-2f30f4a6a243|Dorothy
    Gale]]'s house fell on her. Nothing is left of her but the [[2e4de19b-3763-415b-8e68-19fefeeab4ee|Silver
    Shoes]].
